# USE CASES

### METHODOLOGIES 
- MECE (Mutually Exclusive Collectively Exhaustive)
  - This helps you split problem into buckets tthat do not overlap and do no miss anything important. 
  - *ME* - The buckets should not overlap. If a question about account status, is should not also be under customer demographics unless it truly has tow seprate meanings.
  - "CE" - The buckets should cover the whole problem. If we ask about customers, accounts, transactions, business purpose, and department usage, we should not leave out onboarding or data ownership.


