### 1. CUSTOMER SEGMENTATION
*Business Problem* - Keystone Bank wants to segment customer so that marketing, risk, product, service, and analytics teams can understand customer behaviour and make better decisions (i.e. increase revenue by offering the right products)
*Core Challenge* - Different teams may mean different things by custoemr, account, active, dormant, high value, risky, loyal, and segment
*MECE goal* - Seperate the problem into clean parts before designing tables, measures, models, dashboards, or data science features.

